    "long_instructions": "#Milestone One\r\n\r\n**Goal**: Explore the datasets offered and choose the one that you will build your Interactive Data Dashboard around.\r\n\r\n1. **Explore Datasets:** Examine the context and fields available in each.\r\n2. **Choose Your Dataset:** Rename your chosen dataset to `dataset.js`. Save it into the backpack for use in your project.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** Find your own dataset on an external site. Import the data into a blank JavaScript file and ask AI Tutor to assist with converting it into an array of objects.",
